{"id":10612,"date":"2026-05-25T12:32:01","date_gmt":"2026-05-25T12:32:01","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/?p=10612"},"modified":"2026-05-25T12:32:01","modified_gmt":"2026-05-25T12:32:01","slug":"pest-control-melbourne-rats-why-restaurant-kitchens-are-the-1-target-for-rodents","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/pest-control-melbourne-rats-why-restaurant-kitchens-are-the-1-target-for-rodents\/","title":{"rendered":"Pest Control Melbourne Rats: Why Restaurant Kitchens Are the #1 Target for Rodents"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Let me ask you something.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You close your restaurant at night, turn off the lights, lock the door. And then what happens inside your kitchen?<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Most owners don&#8217;t think about it. But rats and mice? They&#8217;re very much thinking about it. The moment your staff leaves, they come out. They run across your benches. They chew through packaging. They nest behind your equipment.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">And by the time you notice, the problem&#8217;s already been going on for weeks.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This is the reality for a lot of Melbourne food businesses. And it&#8217;s exactly why <\/span><b>pest control Melbourne rats<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> calls from caf\u00e9 and restaurant owners are so common. If you haven&#8217;t thought about <\/span><b>mice pest control Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for your kitchen yet, this is your sign to start.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><b>Your Kitchen Is Basically a Free Buffet for Rodents<\/b><\/h2>\n<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-10609\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-22-at-11.10.44-AM-300x200.jpeg\" alt=\"mice pest control melbourne\" width=\"668\" height=\"445\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-22-at-11.10.44-AM-300x200.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-22-at-11.10.44-AM.jpeg 484w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 668px) 100vw, 668px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">No offence, but from a rat&#8217;s point of view, your kitchen is perfect.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">There&#8217;s food everywhere. Even the cleanest kitchen has grease behind the fryer, crumbs near the storage shelf, and leftover smells that rodents can detect from metres away. Add in the warmth from ovens, the moisture from pipes, and the dozens of hidden gaps behind equipment. You&#8217;ve basically built a five-star home for them.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Mice are even harder to deal with. A house mouse can squeeze through a gap roughly the size of your pinky finger. Most kitchens have at least a few of those spots, behind pipes, under doors, near vents, and they go unnoticed for months.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The worst part? Rodents are mostly active between midnight and 4am. Your kitchen could have a serious <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/our-services\/rodent-control-melbourne\/\"><b>pest control Melbourne rats<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> situation going on and your morning staff would have no idea.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><b>What&#8217;s Actually at Stake Here<\/b><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Some owners think &#8220;it&#8217;s just one mouse, it&#8217;s fine.&#8221; It&#8217;s really not.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Your food safety rating is on the line.<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Melbourne councils inspect food businesses regularly. If an inspector walks in and finds droppings behind your prep bench or gnaw marks on your stock, that&#8217;s a potential closure. And that kind of thing gets around fast on Google reviews.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Your customers&#8217; health matters too.<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Rats carry Salmonella, Leptospirosis, and other nasties. They don&#8217;t need to touch your food directly. Walking across a surface at night is enough to leave contamination behind. This is why proper <\/span><b>mice pest control Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is not something you delay.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Your stock takes a hit.<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> One rat can chew through sealed bags, contaminate bulk ingredients, and cause damage that costs you hundreds in a single night. They also gnaw on electrical wiring, which is a fire risk that most people don&#8217;t even think about.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This is why <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/our-services\/rodent-control-melbourne\/\"><b>mice pest control Melbourne<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> isn&#8217;t just a nice-to-have for food businesses. It&#8217;s a basic part of keeping your doors open legally and safely.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>How Do You Know If You Already Have a Problem?<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You might not see the rat itself. But the signs are usually sitting right there if you look:<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Droppings<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> near walls, behind fridges, or inside storage cupboards. Rat droppings are roughly olive-pit sized. Mouse droppings are much smaller, almost like a grain of rice.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Gnaw marks<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> on food bags, wooden shelves, soft skirting boards, or cables behind appliances.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Dark smear marks<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> along the base of walls. Rats follow the same route every night and leave grease trails over time.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>That weird smell.<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> A sharp, musky odour coming from under equipment or in corners often means there&#8217;s an active nest nearby.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Scratching at night.<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> If you&#8217;ve ever stayed back late and heard movement inside the walls, that&#8217;s not the building settling.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">One or two of these signs is enough reason to call a <\/span><b>rat exterminator Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> professional straight away. Waiting only gives the infestation more time to grow. Proper <\/span><b>mice pest control Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> at the first sign always saves you more money and stress down the line.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Why a Trap from the Hardware Store Won&#8217;t Fix This<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Look, snap traps and supermarket bait stations work fine for a single mouse at home. In a commercial kitchen, they&#8217;re practically useless.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Rats are actually really suspicious of new things in their environment. A trap placed in the wrong spot, or not placed at the right time, will just be walked around and ignored. And in a restaurant layout with storage rooms, drainage systems, and multiple entry points, there are simply too many hiding spots for basic traps to cover.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A proper <\/span><b>rodent removal Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> service is completely different. Professionals read how rodents move. They know where to look, what bait works, and most importantly, how to seal the entry points so new ones don&#8217;t just replace the old ones.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">That last part is what most people miss. You can kill every rat in the building, but if the gap behind your dishwasher pipe is still open, more will come within days. <\/span><b>Mouse exterminator Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> professionals seal those gaps as part of the job.<\/span><\/p>\n<h4><b>Simple Habits That Actually Help<\/b><\/h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">After a professional treatment, these things make a real difference day to day:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Empty your bins every single night, don&#8217;t leave them full inside<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Keep dry goods in hard sealed containers, not just the original packaging<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Check incoming deliveries for signs of damage or droppings before bringing them in<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Fix dripping taps and leaking pipes, moisture pulls rodents in<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Do a quick monthly check on gaps around pipes and doors<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Don&#8217;t leave food scraps or dirty pans sitting out after close<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Small habits combined with regular <\/span><b>mouse control Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> check-ups keep your kitchen clean between professional visits.<\/span><\/p>\n<h4><b>What Happens When You Call 7 States Pest Control<\/b><\/h4>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-10608\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-22-at-11.10.45-AM-300x200.jpeg\" alt=\"mice pest control melbourne\" width=\"665\" height=\"443\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-22-at-11.10.45-AM-300x200.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-22-at-11.10.45-AM-1024x683.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-22-at-11.10.45-AM-768x512.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-22-at-11.10.45-AM.jpeg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 665px) 100vw, 665px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Here&#8217;s how our <\/span><b>rat control Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> treatment works for a restaurant:<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>First, a full inspection.<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Not just the kitchen. The whole property. Storage rooms, roof void, drainage, external walls, delivery areas. Rodents use all of these and our team checks every single one.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Then, a proper plan.<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Based on what&#8217;s actually found, not a one-size-fits-all approach. Some infestations need bait stations, some need trapping, some need both. <\/span><b>Mice control Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> situations are handled differently to heavy rat infestations.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Entry point sealing.<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Every gap around pipes, vents, doors, and wall cavities gets sealed properly. This is the step that makes the <\/span><b>mice pest control Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> treatment last long term.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Follow-up visits.<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> At 7 States Pest Control, we don&#8217;t just come once and disappear. Our <\/span><b>local rodent experts Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> come back to check, monitor, and make sure the <\/span><b>pest control Melbourne rats<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> job is fully resolved.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Rats and mice don&#8217;t care how good your food is or how hard you&#8217;ve worked to build your business. They care about warmth, food, and shelter, and your kitchen has all three.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The damage they cause goes way beyond the physical. It&#8217;s your reputation. Your food safety rating. Your staff feeling comfortable at work. Your customers trusting what&#8217;s on their plate.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you&#8217;ve spotted any of the warning signs, or you just want to make sure your restaurant is protected, 7 States Pest Control is ready to help. Our <\/span><b>local rodent experts Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> will come out, inspect your property properly, and put together a plan that actually works.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/contact-us\/\"><b>Call us today <\/b><\/a><b>or grab a free quote. Same-day service is available right across Melbourne.<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Get professional<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/\"> <b>pest control Melbourne<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> solutions for all types of infestations. From<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/our-services\/spider-control-treatment-melbourne\/\"> <b>spider control services<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to complete<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/our-services\/spider-control-treatment-melbourne\/\"> <b>spider removal service<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, we ensure safe results. We also offer<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/our-services\/fox-pest-control-in-melbourne\/\"> <b>fox population control<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> and<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/our-services\/possum-pest-control\/\"> <b>possum removal service Melbourne<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. Keep your home secure with<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/our-services\/termite-pest-control\/\"> <b>termite control Melbourne<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> and effective<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/our-services\/termite-pest-control\/\"> <b>termite treatment Melbourne<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Let me ask you something. You close your restaurant at night, turn off the lights, lock the door. And then what happens inside your kitchen? Most owners don&#8217;t think about it. But rats and mice? They&#8217;re very much thinking about it. The moment your staff leaves, they come out. They run across your benches. They [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":10607,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-10612","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-blog"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v25.4 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Pest Control Melbourne Rats: Why Restaurant Kitchens Are 1<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Find out why Melbourne restaurant kitchens attract rats and mice, and how professional pest control keeps your business safe and compliant.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/pest-control-melbourne-rats-why-restaurant-kitchens-are-the-1-target-for-rodents\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Pest Control Melbourne Rats: Why Restaurant Kitchens Are 1\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Find out why Melbourne restaurant kitchens attract rats and mice, and how professional pest control keeps your business safe and compliant.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/pest-control-melbourne-rats-why-restaurant-kitchens-are-the-1-target-for-rodents\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"7 States Pest Control\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2026-05-25T12:32:01+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-22-at-11.11.51-AM.jpeg\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image\/jpeg\" \/>\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"7 States Pest Control\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"7 States Pest Control\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. reading time\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data2\" content=\"6 minutes\" \/>\n<script type=\"application\/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https:\/\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/pest-control-melbourne-rats-why-restaurant-kitchens-are-the-1-target-for-rodents\/#article\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/pest-control-melbourne-rats-why-restaurant-kitchens-are-the-1-target-for-rodents\/\"},\"author\":{\"name\":\"7 States Pest Control\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/#\/schema\/person\/d2eebd8e6e8b6f07170a10bc11d3dadb\"},\"headline\":\"Pest Control Melbourne Rats: Why Restaurant Kitchens Are the #1 Target for Rodents\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-05-25T12:32:01+00:00\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/pest-control-melbourne-rats-why-restaurant-kitchens-are-the-1-target-for-rodents\/\"},\"wordCount\":1272,\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/#organization\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/pest-control-melbourne-rats-why-restaurant-kitchens-are-the-1-target-for-rodents\/#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-22-at-11.11.51-AM.jpeg\",\"articleSection\":[\"Blog\"],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/pest-control-melbourne-rats-why-restaurant-kitchens-are-the-1-target-for-rodents\/\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/pest-control-melbourne-rats-why-restaurant-kitchens-are-the-1-target-for-rodents\/\",\"name\":\"Pest Control Melbourne Rats: Why Restaurant Kitchens Are 1\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/#website\"},\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/pest-control-melbourne-rats-why-restaurant-kitchens-are-the-1-target-for-rodents\/#primaryimage\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/pest-control-melbourne-rats-why-restaurant-kitchens-are-the-1-target-for-rodents\/#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-22-at-11.11.51-AM.jpeg\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-05-25T12:32:01+00:00\",\"description\":\"Find out why Melbourne restaurant kitchens attract rats and mice, and how professional pest control keeps your business safe and compliant.\",\"breadcrumb\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/pest-control-melbourne-rats-why-restaurant-kitchens-are-the-1-target-for-rodents\/#breadcrumb\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"ReadAction\",\"target\":[\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/pest-control-melbourne-rats-why-restaurant-kitchens-are-the-1-target-for-rodents\/\"]}]},{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"@id\":\"ht